It is Wednesday morning.
I leave my flat.
I meet my neighbour on the stairs.
"Good morning, Frau Krüger," I say.
"Good morning, Frau Flores," she answers.
"Do you have time today?" she asks me.
"We can drink a coffee together."
"Perhaps at six o'clock?"
I am very happy.
"Yes, gladly!" I answer quickly.
Then I briefly look at my mobile phone.
Oh no!
Today at six o'clock I already have an appointment.
My appointment at the hairdresser is exactly at six o'clock!
What do I do now?
I smile at Frau Krüger.
"Six o'clock fits wonderfully," I say.
"See you tonight," she says and walks on.
I will just call the hair salon later.
